{'symbol': 'JCI', 'date': '2021-09-15 17:01:00', 'title': 'JOHNSON CONTROLS ANNOUNCES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': 'CORK, IRELAND, SEPT. 15, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF JOHNSON CONTROLS INTERNATIONAL PLC (NYSE: JCI) APPROVED A REGULAR QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF\xa0$0.27\xa0PER COMMON SHARE PAYABLE ON OCTOBER 15, 2021 TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON SEPTEMBER 27, 2021.'}{'symbol': 'JCI', 'date': '2021-09-15 06:55:00', 'title': 'JOHNSON CONTROLS SELECTS TEMPERED NETWORKS TO PROVIDE ZERO TRUST SECURE COMMUNICATIONS, FURTHER ADVANCING CYBERSECURITY LEADERSHIP FOR OPENBLUE SERVICES', 'text': "CORK, IRELAND, SEPT. 15, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0JOHNSON CONTROLS (NYSE: JCI), THE GLOBAL LEADER FOR SMART, HEALTHY AND SUSTAINABLE BUILDINGS, SELECTED TEMPERED NETWORKS TO PROVIDE BEST-IN-CLASS SECURE COMMUNICATIONS AND NETWORK MANAGEMENT FOR ITS OPENBLUE SERVICES, FURTHER ADVANCING CYBERSECURITY LEADERSHIP FOR THE COMPANY'S SMART BUILDINGS TECHNOLOGY ECOSYSTEM."}